      "s": "Bloomberg Tech",
      "t": "Emerging-Market Stocks Set to Erase 2026 Gains on AI Selloff",
      "d": "Emerging-market stocks are set to erase this year’s gains as mounting concerns over the sustainability of the artificial-intelligence trade fuel a global selloff stretching from the US to Asia.",
      "u": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/emerging-market-stocks-set-to-erase-2026-gains-on-ai-selloff",
      "m": "11. 23. AM 01:02",
      "ts": 1795395767000,
      "fullText": "Technology Emerging-Market Stocks Set to Erase 2026 Gains on AI Selloff Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Gift this article Contact us: Provide news feedback or report an error Confidential tip? Send a tip to our reporters Site feedback: Take our Survey New Window Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift By Prima Wirayani November 23, 2026 at 1:02 AM UTC Updated on November 23, 2026 at 2:12 AM UTC Bookmark Save Emerging-market stocks are set to erase this year’s gains as mounting concerns over the sustainability of the artificial-intelligence trade fuel a global selloff stretching from the US to Asia. An MSCI Inc.’s gauge for developing-market equities slid as much as 1.4% 1,400.75 on Monday before paring some losses. It’s on track for an eighth straight day of declines, the longest losing streak since 2023. The gauge entered a bear market on Friday after sliding more than 20% from a June peak."
